	(text "RETAINED DISARM: U701 Q clears on rail/link/protection loss and on driver/watchdog faults while ARM_REQ is high.\nACK must rise while disarmed, driver enabled, nFAULT high and watchdog valid. An ACK held high across recovery cannot set Q.\nCORE_PROTECTIONS_OK and WAKE_PROTECTIONS_OK remain pulled low; OC/OV/thermal/brake qualifier circuits are unfinished.\nFAULT_N is open-drain and requires a controller-domain pull-up plus P_ALIVE supervision. No bench/timing validation claimed."
